OL,3,GNEWSA'What does it say if a woman can't
OL,4,Agive birth in her own city?'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who was rushed 40 miles (64km)
OL,7,Fto a maternity unit after going into
OL,8,Fpremature labour says her experience
OL,9,Fshows why services must remain at her
OL,10,Flocal hospital.
OL,12,FBecause she required specialist care,
OL,13,Fmidwives at Daisy Hill in Newry wanted
OL,14,Fto send Natasha Daryaie to Craigavon
OL,15,FArea Hospital but were told there was
OL,16,Fno room.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
