OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'What does it say if a woman can't
OL,4,Agive birth in her own city?'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Southern Health Trust plans to
OL,7,Ftemporarily transfer inpatient
OL,8,Fmaternity services from Daisy Hill to
OL,9,FCraigavon because it has been unable to
OL,10,Frecruit enough consultant obstetricians
OL,11,Fto safely staff both hospitals.
OL,13,FA spokesperson for the trust said that,
OL,14,Ffollowing operational and workforce
OL,15,Fassessments, inpatient maternity care
OL,16,Fat Craigavon had been identified as the
OL,17,Fsafest and most sustainable arrangement
OL,18,Ffor maintaining services.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
